## 6. File-by-file cheat sheet (week3-codealong)

| File | Role in one line |
|------|------------------|
| `index.html` | the single page; contains `<div id="root">` and loads `main.jsx` |
| `src/main.jsx` | mounts `<App/>` into `#root` inside `<StrictMode>` |
| `src/App.jsx` | **the brain** — all state, fetch, cart logic, screen switching |
| `src/components/Header.jsx` | logo + Vendors/Cart buttons; shows the `cartCount` badge |
| `src/components/Footer.jsx` | copyright line, no props/state |
| `src/components/VendorCard.jsx` | one vendor card; guard `if (!vendor) return null`; template-literal class |
| `src/components/MenuItemCard.jsx` | one dish + Add button; disables when out of stock; `toFixed(2)` for price |
| `src/components/MenuList.jsx` | maps items -> cards; empty-state message; supplies `key` |
| `src/components/CartPage.jsx` | cart list + total + CheckoutForm; **BUG-3: total hardcoded 0** |
| `src/components/CartItem.jsx` | one cart row; **BUG-4: +/line-total/Remove are TODOs** |
| `src/components/Status.jsx` | small `Loading()` and `ErrorMessage({message,onRetry})` helpers (App writes its own instead) |
| `src/CheckoutForm.jsx` | controlled form + `validate()`; **BUG-5: validation & submit incomplete** |
| `src/Posts.jsx` | teaching demo: fetch + loading/error + AbortController cleanup |
| `src/SearchList.jsx` | teaching demo: controlled input + DERIVED filtered list |

### CheckoutForm.jsx key points
```jsx
const MAHALLAHS = ['Ali','Aminah','Faruq','Asiah','Bilal','Hafsa','Uthman','Zubair']

function validate(values) {
  const errors = {}
  if (values.name.trim().length < 3) errors.name = 'Enter your name (at least 3 characters).'
  // TODO: mahallah must be chosen
  // TODO: pickupTime must be between '07:00' and '22:00'
  return errors   // empty object = valid
}
```
- **Controlled inputs:** `value={values.name}` + `onChange={handleChange}`.
- **One handler for all fields:** `const { name, value } = event.target; setValues(prev => ({...prev, [name]: value}))`.
- **`event.preventDefault()`** stops the page reload on submit.
- Submit should call `onPlaceOrder(values)` only when `errors` is empty.

