## 7. Bugs & gotchas (likely test gold)

> **BUG-1 — `lastOrder` / `setLastOrder` never defined (App.jsx).**
> `handlePlaceOrder` calls `setLastOrder(...)` and the `'done'` view reads `lastOrder`, but no `useState` declares them -> "setLastOrder is not defined" at runtime.
> **Fix:** `const [lastOrder, setLastOrder] = useState(null)`.

> **BUG-2 — duplicate cart state (App.jsx).**
> Two carts exist: `cart` (used) and `cartItems` (declared + saved but never read). Dead code.
> **Fix:** delete the `cartItems` state + its effect.

> **BUG-3 — cart total not computed (CartPage.jsx).**
> `const total = 0 // TODO`.
> **Fix:** `const total = cart.reduce((sum, line) => sum + line.item.price * line.qty, 0)`.

> **BUG-4 — CartItem TODOs (CartItem.jsx).**
> `+` button -> `onClick={() => onChangeQty(item.id, 1)}` · line total -> `{(item.price * qty).toFixed(2)}` · Remove -> `onClick={() => onRemove(item.id)}`.

> **BUG-5 — CheckoutForm TODOs (CheckoutForm.jsx).**
> `validate` doesn't check `mahallah`/`pickupTime`; `handleSubmit` doesn't call `onPlaceOrder(values)`; the time input + its error aren't rendered.

**GOTCHA-6 — items with no `spiceLevel`.** `item.spiceLevel || 0` treats missing as 0, so those items always show. Without `|| 0`, `undefined <= maxSpice` is `false` and they'd vanish.

**GOTCHA-7 — lazy localStorage init.** `useState(() => {...})` (a function) reads localStorage only on the first render, not every render.

**GOTCHA-8 — naming vs reality.** There's no file literally called "Add Header" (it's the `Header` component) and **no cart Context** (it's props).

